    "created_at": "2022-05-19T21:19:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-19T21:19:01Z",
    "body": "I didn't say it should have any access to anything once the focus moved. It wouldn't be able to access anything about the chrome or other iframes. if focus ends up outside the page that just means focus isn't in the page anymore.\r\n\r\nThis is for handling focus leaving a component and if the component's the last thing on the page focus should behave the same way it would for something built in",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
